OL,3,GNEWSAFair first aid: 130 years of
OL,4,Acaring for revellers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSt John Ambulance has this year marked
OL,7,F130 years of providing first aid to
OL,8,Fvisitors at Hull Fair.
OL,10,FToday, the charity's volunteers provide
OL,11,Fmedical care for anything from minor
OL,12,Finjuries to more serious incidents such
OL,13,Fas cardiac arrests.
OL,15,FThey even provide medical care for
OL,16,Fresidents who live near to the event.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
