OL,3,GNEWSAFair first aid: 130 years of
OL,4,Acaring for revellers
OL,5,
OL,6,FColin Hackett, who is the event lead
OL,7,Ffor the organisation, said compared to
OL,8,F1896 when teams first started attending
OL,9,Fthe Walton Street fair, 2026 was "a lot
OL,10,Fmore applying plasters than it is
OL,11,Famputation."
